### 1. ADD MOVIE
POST http://localhost:8080/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Matrix",
  "releaseYear": 1999,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi",
  "ratingScore": 8.7,
  "ratingVoteCount": 1800000
}

### 2. CREATE ACTOR 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/actors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keanu Reeves",
  "birthYear": 1964
}

### 3. CREATE ACTOR 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/actors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carrie-Anne Moss",
  "birthYear": 1967
}

### 4. ASSIGN ACTOR 1 TO MOVIE
POST http://localhost:8080/api/movies/1/actors/1

### 5. ASSIGN ACTOR 2 TO MOVIE
POST http://localhost:8080/api/movies/1/actors/2

### 6. ADD MOVIE DETAILS
POST http://localhost:8080/api/movies/1/details
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plot": "A computer hacker learns about the true nature of reality.",
  "budget": 63000000,
  "runtime": 136,
  "productionCompany": "Warner Bros"
}

### 7. VERIFY MOVIE WITH DETAILS AND ACTORS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/movies/1